    {
        "content": "<p>Yes absolutely, it's great practice to add such lemmas to the library despite no immediate application.</p>\n<p>I occasionally wonder what percentage of lemmas in Mathlib are actually used elsewhere in the library and whether this statistic has changed over time. Presumably someone sufficiently motivated could calculate this.</p>",
